# The plasma pistol tapped, at a target three units away that stands still: the
# button pressed for a tick and let go fires a bolt (16 to 20) when it is let go,
# the first trigger's shot; each makes a sixth of the heat gauge, so a player
# who taps every other tick overheats at the ninth and waits until the weapon
# has cooled to a quarter (and taps on).
scenario plasma_pistol_taps
map bloodgulch
start flat_field 77.9 -166.2 0.32 0.0
target 81.0 -166.2 0.32 3.14159265
weapon weapons/plasma pistol/plasma pistol
ticks 300
# aim at the body
input 0 300 pitch=-0.13
input 60 61 fire=1
input 62 63 fire=1
input 64 65 fire=1
input 66 67 fire=1
input 68 69 fire=1
input 70 71 fire=1
input 72 73 fire=1
input 74 75 fire=1
input 76 77 fire=1
input 78 79 fire=1
input 80 81 fire=1
input 82 83 fire=1
input 84 85 fire=1
input 86 87 fire=1
input 88 89 fire=1
input 90 91 fire=1
input 92 93 fire=1
input 94 95 fire=1
input 96 97 fire=1
input 98 99 fire=1
input 190 191 fire=1
input 192 193 fire=1
input 194 195 fire=1
input 196 197 fire=1
input 198 199 fire=1
input 200 201 fire=1
input 202 203 fire=1
input 204 205 fire=1
input 206 207 fire=1
input 208 209 fire=1
input 210 211 fire=1
input 212 213 fire=1
input 214 215 fire=1
input 216 217 fire=1
input 218 219 fire=1
input 220 221 fire=1
input 222 223 fire=1
input 224 225 fire=1
input 226 227 fire=1
input 228 229 fire=1

